        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/90ced4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-27T13:27:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok, finally the game is arrived in far far away Italy and while I’m translating rules, a question arise:</p>\n<p>My hero is Bunker and we play in Megalopolis.<br>\nThe environment card that say “Hero cannot draw cards” enter play.</p>\n<p>Can Bunker use his innate power (Draw a card) to draw a card or not?<br>\nIt’s, in general, a Hero Innate Power to take precedence over environment cards?</p>\n<p>My thoughts is that Bunker cannot draw cards… but I want to know your opinions…</p>\n<p>Thanks!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:48.772Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
