        "created_at": "2011-09-28T04:07:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Specifically, you are referencing Bunker’s card “Ammo Drop” which only allows Bunker’s player to play cards when a Mode would otherwise prohibit card draw.  Ammo Drop cannot let you draw cards when something other than a Mode is preventing card draw, though.</p>",
